          "expr": "count((sum by (subscription, device) (increase(vpn_usage_traffic_bytes_total{subscription=~\"${subscription:regex}\",device!=\"\"}[$__range]))) > 0) or on() (0 * sum(increase(vpn_usage_traffic_bytes_total{subscription=~\"${subscription:regex}\"}[$__range])))",
